# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# PVK-042: the standard chords answer from the one table the menus read.
wait 10
click-row 1
wait 3
note Cmd+I opens Get info for the selection
key i ctrl
wait 6
expect-windows 2
expect-title a.txt info
key w ctrl
wait 3
note Cmd+E begins the rename, in place
key e ctrl
wait 3
expect-renaming 1
key Escape
wait 2
quit
